{"event_type":"review","id":"775b34123d91d53a7c502ad2e9b513c085bca16289508144cffc6247d848fe35","occurred_at":"2026-11-06T04:29:11Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/c3646a56f45d1a87dc484ea5d594756eb9720acbb3f61b6dd7dd52523e26cc42","sha256":"c3646a56f45d1a87dc484ea5d594756eb9720acbb3f61b6dd7dd52523e26cc42"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e0a1c037ffaf3bb1bbdca47904126c2d07173823d291c0d3af0a584d5a819249","sha256":"e0a1c037ffaf3bb1bbdca47904126c2d07173823d291c0d3af0a584d5a819249"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/ae210d2b79872aecf15b504f274ae4cfbdffc8f4369ce50f6833554ab332c2cc","sha256":"ae210d2b79872aecf15b504f274ae4cfbdffc8f4369ce50f6833554ab332c2cc"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/ba81d52b316580edaf780c84d79a40eba2ff0b1ac72676e03e70408218e8ca2f","sha256":"ba81d52b316580edaf780c84d79a40eba2ff0b1ac72676e03e70408218e8ca2f"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/9bd60df3c34772ce4591fed75652543aa7b4c1d888815307b6c41e4925144b45","sha256":"9bd60df3c34772ce4591fed75652543aa7b4c1d888815307b6c41e4925144b45"}],"attempt_id":"d6c9ea7dcd53d6e2a589a40c2bcec08b0f59f3e2db3ce3356597f90f8747febd:0:1","base":"1adb356cecc9f9b157486071cac7067a4b945664","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"6be7871b2a6e4ccf73bf68e3978cd926a5571e76","body":"**Isolate the real `GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY` and `SWEEP_USAGE_OUT` in the peak-credential suite.**\n\nIn `main — usage reporting`, `setup()` stubs both variables at Line 1008-1009. This suite does not stub them.\n\nThree tests reach the code that writes the step summary:\n- Line 1461: a real sweep.\n- Line 1506: a dry run.\n- Line 1538: a real sweep.\n\nEach one calls `appendStepSummaryTable(process.env['GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY'], …)` at `src/selfhost/self-review-loop.ts:1005`. GitHub Actions always sets `GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY`, so a CI test run appends \"Sweep token usage\" tables for fixture PRs to the test job's real step summary.\n\n`writeSweepUsageFile` at `src/selfhost/self-review-loop.ts:1015` has the same exposure if `SWEEP_USAGE_OUT` is set in the environment.\n\nTo fix this, stub both variables to `''` in a `beforeEach`. Both helpers treat `''` as absent (`src/selfhost/self-review-loop.ts:775`, `797`).\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n describe('main — peak-aware driver credential (fail closed)', () => {\n   const originalArgv = process.argv;\n+  beforeEach(() => {\n+    vi.stubEnv('GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY', '');\n+    vi.stubEnv('SWEEP_USAGE_OUT', '');\n+  });\n   afterEach(() => {\n     vi.unstubAllEnvs();\n     vi.restoreAllMocks();\n     process.argv = originalArgv;\n   });\n```\n\nAdd `beforeEach` to the `vitest` import at Line 75.\n</details>","id":"39cd5e7f96494537d92ef29d390ad59f778de0ea899a25648eb5d7628ba021ae","intervals":[],"path":"test/selfhost/self-review-loop.test.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Isolate the real `GITHUBSTEPSUMMARY` and `SWEEPUSAGEOUT` in the peak-credential suite."},{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"7cca34e33cd459e52c22cf40a2371a7782fc1810","body":"**Include reasoning tokens in the sweep budget.**\n\nWhen `Usage.reasoning` is present, `totalTokens` omits tokens counted by the governor (`src/kernel/governor.ts:870-871`). The sweep can carry too much budget forward on both the normal and thrown paths (`src/selfhost/self-review-loop.ts:688-708`).\n\n<details>\n<summary>Fix the token fold</summary>\n\n```diff\n-  usage === undefined ? 0 : usage.input + usage.output + usage.cacheRead + usage.cacheWrite;\n+  usage === undefined ? 0 : usage.input + usage.output + usage.cacheRead + usage.cacheWrite + (usage.reasoning ?? 0);\n```\n\n</details>","id":"59305e6cedd5b80ed04d6ce56aeeff9e05ea8bf742aeaedfe4e406452c3402a2","intervals":[],"path":"src/plans/review-loop.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Include reasoning tokens in the sweep budget."}],"head":"f3967e22412f0e14eafa39bafdd085f9d2e572a9","head_tree":"74119e2e60617e97b4070712a18195b8b48c1179","input_scope":[{"blob":"7cca34e33cd459e52c22cf40a2371a7782fc1810","intervals":[[9,9],[12,15],[76,82],[100,102],[108,109],[112,113],[115,116],[118,120],[156,311],[371,372],[381,383],[411,416],[472,492],[495,497],[502,508],[513,514],[567,574],[682,685],[779,828],[921,927],[931,951],[960,1008],[1051,1127],[1148,1153],[1157,1159],[1175,1177],[1179,1269],[1271,1271],[1302,1302],[1312,1312],[1319,1334],[1507,1517],[1520,1527],[1530,1533],[1535,1539],[1547,1551],[1555,1564],[1574,1574],[1637,1643],[1645,1689],[1691,1691],[1750,1751],[1764,1764],[1776,1776],[1796,1797]],"path":"src/plans/review-loop.ts"},{"blob":"3ede48b8ef35b5638a7cc5631ee7849ac7791c19","intervals":[[17,18],[22,43],[71,83],[86,91],[94,100],[246,249],[251,264],[303,304],[307,382],[424,427],[511,519],[522,533],[547,554],[572,572],[631,631],[641,641],[648,649],[666,666],[668,668],[685,686],[688,695],[704,705],[707,710],[714,716],[724,850],[855,868],[870,884],[886,932],[936,936],[941,1015]],"path":"src/selfhost/self-review-loop.ts"},{"blob":"6be7871b2a6e4ccf73bf68e3978cd926a5571e76","intervals":[[64,72],[75,75],[78,78],[81,87],[89,89],[202,210],[301,303],[313,315],[329,383],[600,666],[830,830],[886,895],[934,1556]],"path":"test/selfhost/self-review-loop.test.ts"}],"job_id":"d6c9ea7dcd53d6e2a589a40c2bcec08b0f59f3e2db3ce3356597f90f8747febd:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"entry":{"blob":"b654976307e26f6499edd58293d4cc991e81b9fc","kind":"blob","mode":"100644","path":"src/selfhost/self-review-loop.ts"},"merge":"d8da1e2f8a592f1858a1bf97cb04a729ce9f6d3b","method":"pre-merge","pre":"34401d741bd653d722472f4e99a1dca6040433ce","source_path":"src/selfhost/self-review-loop.ts"},"blob":"3ede48b8ef35b5638a7cc5631ee7849ac7791c19","di